      "targetClauseIds": [
        "werner-ququart-two-copy-nondistillability"
      ],
      "relation": "resolves",
      "title": "Werner states are 2-copy distillable only if 1-copy distillable",
      "text": "Fu, Gao and Park prove that a Werner state in any local dimension is 2-copy distillable if and only if it is already 1-copy distillable, which in the archived parametrisation gives 2-copy non-distillability exactly for alpha at least -1/2 and therefore includes rho(4,-1/2). Song and Chen, Fraser, Huber, Pozsgay and Vona, and Bharti, Gajjala and Haug posted concurrent independent proofs of the same sharp two-copy threshold, so the archived statement is affirmed.",
